Subject: [PATCH 02/11] fix: mark past-dated games as played (Clubee scores
 often not entered)

Clubee admins record results in standings but rarely enter individual
game scores. Fall back to date comparison: if game date < today,
treat as played (score unknown). This correctly classifies already-
played fixtures so the sim shows them as results rather than upcoming.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01U8MeSzR4QTsX3mF5CyQBL9
