From ca40f769181a3e49c191e5f12de02dc75b6a20e9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 12:40:56 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 05/11] Fix standings table: seed P/W/D/L/GF/GA from ranking
 array

calcStats now accepts a ranking param. When no scored fixtures exist,
P/W/D/L/GF/GA/Pts are seeded directly from the Clubee ranking data
(already in vhv-data.json). If scored fixtures are present they take
precedence and are computed from scratch (no double-counting).

Also pass league.ranking into regStats/SimStep so the playoff
source ordering uses real standings.

